AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002002> "A 2D boundary may have holes and gaps, but it must be a single connected entity, not an aggregate of several disconnected parts."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002002> "Although the boundary is two-dimensional, it exists in three-dimensional space and thus has a 3D shape."@en)
