AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<https://w3id.org/sssom/mapping_justification> <https://w3id.org/semapv/vocab/UnspecifiedMatching>) <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0000134> "ZFA:0009081")
