# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0005929> (cilium)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "GOC:cilia") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "GOC:curators") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "GOC:kmv") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "GOC:vw") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "ISBN:0198547684") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:16824949") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:17009929") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:20144998") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0005929> "A specialized eukaryotic organelle that consists of a filiform extrusion of the cell surface and of some cytoplasmic parts. Each cilium is largely bounded by an extrusion of the cytoplasmic (plasma) membrane, and contains a regular longitudinal array of microtubules, anchored to a basal body.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002161> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0005929> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_3176>)
