AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#id> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0000440> "UBERON:0000440")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0000440> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/uberon/core#grouping_class>)
