AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#date_retrieved> "2012-09-17") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#external_class> "VHOG:0001674") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#ontology> "VHOG") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#source> "DOI:10.1073/pnas.97.9.4449 Shimeld SM and Holland PW. Vertebrate innovations. PNAS (2000)") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#source> "http://bgee.unil.ch/") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBPROP_0000003> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0001032> "An early step in the evolution of neural crest, therefore, may have been the origin of a specific dorsal neural cell population contributing to sensory processing; this would predate the divergence of the amphioxus and vertebrate lineages.[well established][VHOG]")
