AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0002385> "Vertebrate muscle is categorized into three major muscle types defined by their structural and functional properties: skeletal, cardiac and smooth. In Dmel the counterparts are somatic, heart/cardiac and visceral. Here we take a cell type based approach.")
