AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0006777> "The term \"tectal plate\" (or \"quadrigeminal plate\") is used to describe the junction of the gray and white matter in the embryo. (NeuroNames ancil-453)")
